#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/tools/ide/index.rst:4
msgid ""
"OpenMV IDE is the desktop application for working with your OpenMV Cam. "
"Everything in it serves one loop: edit a MicroPython script, run it on "
"the camera, and watch the frame buffer and serial output stream back live"
" while it executes. The IDE is built on the Qt Creator editor core, and "
"the whole application is shaped around that loop -- a script needs no "
"project files, build configurations, or compiler setup. You write a "
"script and run it on a camera; that is the whole model."
msgstr ""
"OpenMV IDE adalah aplikasi desktop untuk bekerja dengan OpenMV Cam Anda. "
"Semua yang ada di dalamnya melayani satu siklus: edit skrip MicroPython, "
"jalankan di kamera, dan pantau buffer bingkai dan output serial yang "
"mengalir kembali secara langsung saat dieksekusi. IDE dibangun di atas "
"inti editor Qt Creator, dan seluruh aplikasi dibentuk di sekitar siklus "
"tersebut -- skrip tidak memerlukan file proyek, konfigurasi build, atau "
"setup kompiler. Anda menulis skrip dan menjalankannya di kamera; itulah "
"seluruh modelnya."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/tools/ide/index.rst:15
msgid ""
"The main window has four working regions. The *editor* fills the left "
"side and holds your open scripts, with the *serial terminal* below it "
"showing everything the script prints. The *frame buffer viewer* sits at "
"the top right and shows what the camera last captured, and the "
"*histogram* below it plots the pixel statistics of whatever the frame "
"buffer shows. A column of toolbar buttons down the far left edge holds "
"the file, edit, connect, and run controls, and a status bar along the "
"bottom edge reports what the connected camera is doing. You can collapse "
"any pane when the script needs the room."
msgstr ""
"Jendela utama memiliki empat wilayah kerja. *Editor* mengisi sisi kiri "
"dan menampung skrip terbuka Anda, dengan *terminal serial* di bawahnya "
"yang menampilkan semua yang dicetak skrip. *Penampil buffer bingkai* "
"berada di kanan atas dan menampilkan apa yang terakhir ditangkap kamera, "
"dan *histogram* di bawahnya memplot statistik piksel dari apa pun yang "
"ditampilkan buffer bingkai. Kolom tombol toolbar di sepanjang tepi kiri "
"jauh menampung kontrol file, edit, koneksi, dan jalankan, dan status bar "
"di sepanjang tepi bawah melaporkan apa yang dilakukan kamera yang "
"terhubung. Anda dapat menciutkan panel mana pun saat skrip membutuhkan "
"ruang."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/tools/ide/index.rst:39
msgid ""
"Keyboard shortcuts in this chapter are written for Windows and Linux; on "
"macOS substitute ``Cmd`` for ``Ctrl``."
msgstr ""
"Pintasan keyboard dalam bab ini ditulis untuk Windows dan Linux; di macOS"
" ganti ``Cmd`` untuk ``Ctrl``\\ ."

